{
  "name": "ACTA PRO | 15 - Send Meeting Record",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WORKFLOW 15 — Send Meeting Record\n\nTras firmar y almacenar el acta, obtiene el correo validado del representante (desde Runachay / datos de la reunión) y envía el acta adjunta por Gmail. Registra fecha de envío, destinatario, message_id y marca representative_copy_sent = true.\n\nCONFIGURAR: credencial de Gmail OAuth2.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "ar0hh06yjjmpbtbk",
      "name": "Nota - zi8y",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "meeting_id"
            },
            {
              "name": "student_name"
            },
            {
              "name": "meeting_date"
            },
            {
              "name": "representative_name"
            },
            {
              "name": "representative_email"
            },
            {
              "name": "teacher_name"
            },
            {
              "name": "institution_name"
            },
            {
              "name": "final_document_binary"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "kb1p46dadx4fvl5g",
      "name": "Execute Workflow Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.representative_email }}",
              "rightValue": "^[\\\\w.+-]+@[\\\\w-]+\\\\.[a-zA-Z]{2,}$",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "p2hye3ifvac6wcuh",
      "name": "IF Correo válido",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        260,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.representative_email }}",
        "subject": "=ACTA PRO | Acta de reunión - {{ $json.student_name }} - {{ $json.meeting_date }}",
        "message": "=Estimado/a {{ $json.representative_name }},<br><br>Adjuntamos una copia del acta correspondiente a la reunión realizada el {{ $json.meeting_date }} relacionada con {{ $json.student_name }}.<br><br>Este documento constituye el respaldo de los temas tratados, acuerdos y compromisos establecidos durante la reunión.<br><br>Atentamente,<br>{{ $json.teacher_name }}<br>{{ $json.institution_name }}",
        "options": {
          "attachmentsUi": {}
        }
      },
      "id": "bo33jzi70l6w7kn9",
      "name": "CONFIGURAR - Gmail: enviar acta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        520,
        90.0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": null,
          "name": "CONFIGURAR - Gmail OAuth2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const send = items[0].json;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  meeting_id: $('Execute Workflow Trigger').item.json.meeting_id,\n  sent_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n  recipient: $('Execute Workflow Trigger').item.json.representative_email,\n  message_id: send.id || null,\n  representative_copy_sent: true,\n}}];"
      },
      "id": "s8uadsbzkwdl2dvp",
